[TITLE]
2D surface + aquifer fixture with groundwater transport: two ponded
triangles (initial depths 0.04 m and 0.03 m) infiltrate into a uniform
aquifer that starts at Dye 10 mg/L, while well W injects 1e-6 m3/s at
Dye 3 mg/L into the first triangle (CELL 1 is one-based). No 1D network.
Reduced from the two-triangle aquifer deck in openswmm.engine
python/tests/engine/test_groundwater_checkpoint.py.

[OPTIONS]
FLOW_UNITS CMS
FLOW_ROUTING DYNWAVE
START_DATE 01/01/2026
START_TIME 00:00:00
END_DATE 01/01/2026
END_TIME 00:10:00
REPORT_STEP 00:01:00
ROUTING_STEP 1

[POLLUTANTS]
Dye MG/L 0 0 0 0 NO * 0 0

[2D_OPTIONS]
INTEGRATOR EXPLICIT
LTS_TIERS 1
MAX_TIMESTEP 1
EVAPORATION NO
TRANSPORT_POLLUTANTS YES
REPORT_2D NO

[2D_VERTICES]
0 0 .5
4 0 .5
0 2 .5
4 2 .5

[2D_TRIANGLES]
0 1 2 .03 .04
1 3 2 .03 .03

[2D_AQUIFER_OPTIONS]
CLOSURE CLOSED_FORM
M_LAYERS 4
NODE_ENROLMENT ROWS
LINK_SEEPAGE NONE
GW_ET NONE

[2D_AQUIFER]
* 36 1 .45 .1 2 HG0 .3 C_LOSS .02

[GW_TRANSPORT_OPTIONS]
UNSAT_TRANSPORT BULK
DISPERSION NO

[GW_INITIAL_QUALITY]
* SAT Dye 10
* UNSAT Dye 10

[TIMESERIES]
WELL 0:00 .000001
WELL 1:00 .000001

[GW_SOURCES]
W CELL 1 FLOW WELL Dye CONC 3
